# Communications application settings.
# Copy this file to `communications.env` and adjust the values.

# --- Base path ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The app is served under this path prefix so multiple Vantigo apps can share
# one domain (e.g. https://vantigo.example.com/communications). Defaults to
# /communications. Set to an empty value to serve from the domain root.
# App__BasePath=/communications

# --- Public origin -----------------------------------------------------------
# The public scheme + host users reach the app on (no path — the base path is
# configured separately). Reserved for generated absolute links.
# App__PublicOrigin=https://vantigo.example.com

# --- Whitelabeling -----------------------------------------------------------
# Brand the app as your own. The title replaces "Communications" in the header
# and browser tab; the logo replaces the Vantigo logo in the header. Support
# contact details, when set, appear in a footer and on the sign-in page.
# App__Title=Acme Mail
# App__LogoUrl=https://cdn.example.com/logo.svg
# App__Support__Email=support@example.com
# App__Support__Phone=+47 123 45 678
# App__Support__Url=https://support.example.com
